@startuml
title ALOUTE - Sequence Xác thực Kết nối STOMP WebSocket (Bằng phụ trách)

actor "Trình duyệt (Browser Client)" as Client
boundary "SockJS / Native WebSocket" as WS
control "Nginx Reverse Proxy" as Nginx
control "StompAuthChannelInterceptor" as Interceptor
control "JwtTokenProvider" as JWT
control "CustomUserDetailsService" as UDS
database "UserRepository" as UserRepo
control "SimpleMessageBroker" as Broker

Client -> WS: 1. Khởi tạo kết nối HTTP Upgrade tới /ws
WS -> Nginx: GET /ws (Upgrade: websocket)
Nginx -> WS: 101 Switching Protocols\n(Reverse Proxy pass qua Spring Boot)

Client -> Interceptor: 2. Gửi STOMP CONNECT Frame\nHeaders: Authorization: Bearer <jwt> hoặc cookie aloute_access_token
Interceptor -> JWT: parseUserId(token)

alt Token hợp lệ và còn hạn
    JWT --> Interceptor: userId
    Interceptor -> UDS: loadById(userId)
    UDS -> UserRepo: findById(userId)
    UserRepo --> UDS: User entity
    UDS --> Interceptor: UserPrincipal
    
    Interceptor -> Interceptor: Gán Authentication(UserPrincipal) vào StompHeaderAccessor.setUser()
    Interceptor --> Broker: Cho phép CONNECT
    Broker --> Client: STOMP CONNECTED Frame\n(session-id, heart-beat)
    
    note over Client, Broker: Client bắt đầu SUBSCRIBE các topic cá nhân:\n/user/queue/messages\n/user/queue/notifications
else Token không hợp lệ / Hết hạn
    JWT --> Interceptor: JwtException
    Interceptor --> Client: STOMP ERROR Frame (401 Unauthorized)\nĐóng kết nối WebSocket
end

@enduml
